# Raid-scale 4 Hz combat snapshot pressure test: 25 level-80 bots grouped into a raid fighting a
# raid-boss-ranked Heroic Training Dummy + nearby Grandmaster's Training Dummies in Orgrimmar's
# Valley of Honor. Measures the world-thread cost of building 4 Hz combat snapshots at raid scale.
# Needs a test build (tools/wlb build server --test).
